# Smart Civic Issue Detection and Prioritization System

## Project Overview
The Smart Civic Issue Detection and Prioritization System is a web-based application designed to help citizens report civic problems and help administrators manage and resolve them efficiently.

## Objectives
- Allow citizens to submit civic complaints.
- Upload images of civic issues.
- Store complaint details using SQLite.
- Provide an admin dashboard.
- Track complaint status.
- Explore AI-based detection and prioritization of civic issues.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Flask
- HTML
- CSS
- SQLite
- Roboflow (AI image detection prototype)

## Main Features
1. Citizen Complaint Registration
2. Image Upload
3. Complaint ID Generation
4. Admin Dashboard
5. Complaint Status Management
6. AI-Based Civic Issue Detection (prototype)

## Types of Civic Issues
- Road potholes
- Damaged sidewalks
- Garbage dumping
- Graffiti

